我邀请了西藏颂钵来发出回响
I have invited the Tibetan Singing Bowl to ring,

20
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,820
提醒我们降低音量
reminding us to all turn down the volume

21
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:50,360
在静默中找到美
and find the beauty in silence.

22
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,180
很不幸
That was unfortunate.

23
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,980
抱歉 我们隔壁正好是皇家[队]
My apologies. We happen to be next door to the Royals.

24
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:59,440
天啊 我们刚狂看完皇室剧《王冠》
Oh, my God, we just binged "The Crown".

25
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:01,380
哪些皇室成员 威廉和凯特吗
W-W-Which royals? William and Kate?

26
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:02,460
还是哈里和《诉讼双雄》妹
Harry and the "Suits" girl?

27
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,460
事实上是堪萨斯城皇家队 他们正在春训
Actually, it's the Kansas City Royals. Spring training,

28
00:01:05,820 --> 00:01:07,260
他们的训练场地就在隔壁
their practice field is next door.

29
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:09,800
我从小就是皇家队粉丝 看他们进行春训
Growing up a Royals fan, it was always my dream

30
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:11,320
一直是我的梦想
to see them at spring training.

31
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:13,080
于是我决定 等静修结束
So, I just decided, after the retreat was over,

32
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:14,480
我就过去看看
I'm just gonna swing by,

33
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:15,680
要个签名什么的
you know, grab an autograph,

34
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:18,100
也许在经理耳边说些建议
maybe whisper an opinion in the manager's ear,

35
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:20,180
被发现本人极具棒球头脑
be discovered as a great baseball mind.

36
00:01:20,740 --> 00:01:22,360
然后洋基队就会来找我
Then the Yankees would come calling,

37
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:24,400
再然后我就不得不在热爱的球队
and then I'd have to choose between the team I love

38
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,860
和高薪之间做选择
and the -- the big payout.

39
00:01:25,860 --> 00:01:27,920
现在想这些有点太着急了
But I'm getting ahead of myself.

40
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:30,920
无须担心 这是他们最后一天训练
Not to worry. This is their last day of training,

41
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,100
他们今晚就走了
and they leave tonight.

42
00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:33,620
-不好意思 我有问题 -你说
- Excuse me, question. ?- Yes.

43
00:01:33,620 --> 00:01:36,120
你好 请问我们会否有机会
Yes, hi. Will we have an opportunity to explore

44
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:37,980
自行探索这个美丽的庭院
these -- these beautiful grounds on our own?

45
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:40,160
当然 明天日落时
Absolutely. Tomorrow at sunset.

46
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,600
进行完山羊瑜伽后
After goat yoga.

47
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:45,820
天啊 还能更衰一点吗
Oh, my God! Can it get any worse?!

48
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,240
你在干嘛
What are you doing?

49
00:02:02,420 --> 00:02:04,520
我生乔的时候都没哼那么大声
I grunted less when I was giving birth to Joe.

50
00:02:04,700 --> 00:02:07,280
你只是推出6磅半 我可是撑起220磅
You were pushing six and a half pounds, I'm pushing 220.

51
00:02:08,060 --> 00:02:09,420
你穿了更年轻的衣服
You're dressing younger.

52
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:10,740
你在锻炼身体
You're exercising.

53
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,500
今早你只吃了一份早餐
You only had one breakfast this morning.

54
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:17,000
-那个淫妇是谁 杰 我要杀了她 -冷静点
- Who is she, Jay? I'll kill her. - ?Relax, would ya?

55
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,280
我只是想保持身材
I'm just trying to get in shape.

56
00:02:19,420 --> 00:02:21,020
好吧 不过快点
Okay, but hurry, because we have to go

57
00:02:21,020 --> 00:02:22,440
我们还要去生日派对那接乔
and pick up Joe at the birthday party.

58
00:02:23,180 --> 00:02:24,280
等一下
Wait a minute.

59
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,840
你做这么多就是因为这个吗
Is that what this is all about --

60
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,360
亨利的爸爸
Henry's father?

61
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:29,300
我不明白你为何如此不安
I don't understand why you're so insecure

62
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:31,080
就因为他比你年轻
just because he's younger,

63
00:02:31,300 --> 00:02:33,480
比你强壮 比你粗犷
stronger, and more rugged than you are.

64
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:35,820
悠着点 我在努力只吃一份早餐了
Go easy. I'm working on only one breakfast.

65
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:38,300
乔一天到晚说他新朋友的爸爸
Joe won't shut up about his new friend's dad.

66
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:40,380
"亨利的爸爸好爷们哦" 谁在乎啊
"Henry's dad is so tough". Who cares?

67
00:02:40,580 --> 00:02:42,720
他在几部《谍影重重》里当过特技替身
He was a stunt double in a couple of "Bourne" Movies.

68
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,980
从乔第一次去他们家
From the first time Joe went over there,

69
00:02:44,980 --> 00:02:47,300
那家伙就不停地想证明自己有多酷
that guy's been trying to prove how cool he is.

70
00:02:47,820 --> 00:02:48,900
乔 走了
Joe! Let's go!

71
00:02:49,180 --> 00:02:50,000
小心
Heads up!

72
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:54,220
-什么鬼 -耶
- What the hell?! -Yeah!

73
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:55,493
他是杰森·伯恩
He's Jason Bourne!

74
00:02:55,493 --> 00:02:57,220
那都是演的
That's make-believe.

75
00:02:57,220 --> 00:02:59,480
马特·达蒙才是杰森·伯恩
Matt Damon's Jason Bourne.

76
00:02:59,780 --> 00:03:02,120
小时候 我觉得我爸是最酷的人
Growing up, I thought my dad was the coolest.

77
00:03:02,700 --> 00:03:04,640
那让我对自己也感觉良好
And that made me feel good about myself.

78
00:03:05,060 --> 00:03:06,480
我是说 我努力赶上他
I mean, I try to stay with it.

79
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:09,300
没错 瞧瞧你 你还有智能手表呢
Exactly! Look at you, you even have a smart watch.

80
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:11,240
对 这玩意告诉我何时站起来
Yeah, the damn thing tells me when to stand up,

81
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:11,820
何时呼吸
when to breathe.

82
00:03:12,180 --> 00:03:13,840
你的体重指数是...
Your body mass index is --

83
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,520
没人问你
Nobody asked!

84
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:19,460
哪个有更多染色体 土豆还是人类
Which have more chromosomes, potatoes or humans?

85
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,380
人类 对吧
Humans, right?

86
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:21,640
居然是土豆
Potatoes?!

87
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:26,080
小疯杯 还有你教不了我们的事吗
Oh, Krazy Kups, what can't you teach us?

88
