你做这些都是为了让海莉男朋友觉得你厉害吗
Are you doing all this to impress Haley's boyfriend?

89
00:03:28,660 --> 00:03:30,680
海莉在跟一个天才天体物理学教授谈恋爱
Haley's dating this genius astrophysics professor

90
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,120
不知怎的 他让她变聪明了
who's somehow making her smarter

91
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:34,260
因为上周 我说冥王星是行星
because, last week, I called Pluto a planet

92
00:03:34,260 --> 00:03:35,940
结果海莉嘲笑我
and Haley laughed at me.

93
00:03:35,940 --> 00:03:36,600
同情傻子那种笑
In pity.

94
00:03:37,429 --> 00:03:39,080
-海莉耶 -海莉
- Haley. - ?Haley.

95
00:03:39,736 --> 00:03:40,864
傻妹海莉
Haley.

96
00:03:41,540 --> 00:03:44,780
我们该认为海莉跟教授能合适吗
Do we think that Haley is suited to a professor,

97
00:03:44,780 --> 00:03:47,300
我觉得他跟傻汉比较合适呢
because I more saw her with a Gilligan type?

98
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:49,320
别这样 很多幸福的情侣
Come on, now. Lots of happy couples

99
00:03:49,320 --> 00:03:51,020
智商都不在一个境界
aren't the exact same level of smart.

100
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:53,220
这倒是真的 我俩就行得通
That's true. We work.

101
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:53,860
是啊
Yeah.

102
00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:58,080
等等 你说我俩就行得通
Wait. When you say, "We work,"

103
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:00,320
你是觉得你比我聪明 还是我比你聪明
do you think you're smarter than me or I'm smarter than you?

104
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:02,120
我想我够聪明到不跟你讨论这个
I think I'm smart enough not to have this conversation.

105
00:04:02,260 --> 00:04:03,600
老天
Oh, my God!

106
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:07,000
你就这么想 你认为你比我聪明
You do! You think you're smarter than me!

107
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:09,920
好啊 天才 你有多少项专利
Okay, hotshot. How many patents do you have?

108
00:04:10,780 --> 00:04:12,100
挠头器[第3季第9集] 阿司匹林枪
Headscratcher TM, Aspirin Gun,

109
00:04:12,340 --> 00:04:14,620
能让开车人士不再发脾气的礼貌汽车喇叭
Polite Car Horn that'll put an end to road rage.

110
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,320
不好意思三连
Excuse me, excuse me, excuse me.

111
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:19,020
在这顿午餐前能不能先别争论这个
Can we just not get into a whole thing before this lunch?

112
00:04:19,260 --> 00:04:20,740
什么午餐 我刚吃了个派
What lunch? I just ate a pie.

113
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,660
你姐姐在跟一个天体物理学教授交往
Your sister is dating a professor of astrophysics,

114
00:04:23,660 --> 00:04:25,820
他今天要来见我们
and he's coming here today to meet us.

115
00:04:26,260 --> 00:04:28,040
真好 有人跟我聊天了
Oh, good, someone to talk to.

116
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,960
我受够为了你们俩傻子而特意降低水平了
I'm tired of dumbing it down for you chuckle-heads.

117
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:33,640
比尔 你出发了吗
Bill, are you on your way?

118
00:04:33,980 --> 00:04:35,120
待在车里 我到外面找你
Stay in the car. I'll meet you outside.

119
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:37,400
海莉开始跟阿尔文交往后 我挺难受的
It was hard for me when Haley started dating Arvin,

120
00:04:37,980 --> 00:04:40,160
他可是我的教授和科学英雄
my professor and science hero and...

121
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:42,040
好吧 我还暗恋他
okay, fine, crush.

122
00:04:42,540 --> 00:04:45,700
我很难过 跑回家了 然后可能太过放纵了
I was so upset, I went home, and I may have overindulged...

123
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:48,380
吃了很多贝果
on Bagel Bites.

124
00:04:52,180 --> 00:04:53,554
没事 你安全了
It's okay. You're safe.

125
00:04:53,554 --> 00:04:55,100
但你得跟我走
But I'm gonna need you to come with me.

126
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:56,860
你也没必要...
I don't really think you need --

127
00:04:56,860 --> 00:04:58,680
好吧 他就像超级英雄
Okay. He was like a superhero.

128
00:04:59,180 --> 00:04:59,780
那是你爸爸吗
Is that your dad?

129
00:05:00,020 --> 00:05:01,040
一个英俊
A beautiful...

130
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,560
但智商欠奉的超级英雄
not-so-smart superhero.

131
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:04,420
我最不想要的就是费诺曼教授
The last thing I wanted was Professor Fennerman

132
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,100
发现我在跟一个笨蛋约会
finding out I was dating a dummy.

133
00:05:06,780 --> 00:05:09,360
一个贴心 轮廓分明的笨蛋
A sweet, chiseled dummy.

134
00:05:10,780 --> 00:05:14,020
艾丽克丝 你没说过你有个消防员男朋友啊
Alex, you didn't mention you've got a firefighter boyfriend.

135
00:05:14,020 --> 00:05:15,580
是啊 很棒
Yeah! It's great.

136
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,240
"看我灭了你 火" 我们得走了
"Take that, you fire". We gotta go.

137
00:05:17,420 --> 00:05:19,240
但你父母刚邀我留下吃午餐
Oh, but your parents just invited me to stay for lunch.

138
00:05:19,700 --> 00:05:20,100
赚到啦
Score!

139
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:22,960
顺便说一下 你比海报上看起来年轻多了
By the way, you look way younger than your poster.

140
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:25,680
我们真的该走了 不然...
We really should get going before we --

141
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,717
会赶不上行程计划 对吧
we miss our plans and stuff, right?

142
00:05:27,717 --> 00:05:28,980
-嗯 -是吧
- Yeah. - ?Uh, yeah...

143
00:05:28,980 --> 00:05:30,960
艾丽克丝 我不知道你要一起吃午餐
Alex! I didn't know you were joining us for lunch.

144
00:05:31,740 --> 00:05:32,980
不 不
Oh! No, no.

145
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:36,520
我朋友跟我有安排了 不能取消
My friend and I have some plans we really can't get out of.

146
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:39,400
不 我可以晚点再给你看《烈火雄心》
Oh, no, I could totally just show you "Backdraft" later.

147
00:05:39,500 --> 00:05:42,480
是我哥的影碟 他都不知道我拿走了
It's my brother's DVD. He doesn't even know I took it. So...

148
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,580
爸爸妈妈 这是阿尔文
?Mom, Dad, this is Arvin.

149
00:05:44,820 --> 00:05:46,860
阿尔文你好 很高兴认识你
Hello, Arvin. It's a pleasure to meet you.

150
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:49,640
没错 你可是我们家接待的第一位担任过
Yes, you are the first TED Talkin' science superstar

151
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,000
TED演讲嘉宾的科学超级巨星
we've ever had in our house.

152
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:54,240
只要我是超级巨星而不是超新星就好了
Well, as long as I'm a "Superstar" and not a supernova.

153
00:05:58,820 --> 00:06:00,640
你们都不知道自己在笑什么
You don't even know what you're laughing at.

154
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:01,620
-我懂了 -我更懂
- I get it. - I got it more.

155
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:05,420
我没听懂 但你的口音像《王牌大贱谍》的主角
I don't get it, but, uh, you sound like Austin Powers, man.

156
00:06:10,060 --> 00:06:12,680
亨利的爸爸为孩子们办的生日派对
Wow. Henry's dad did such a great job

157
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,660
真棒啊 对吧
with the birthday party for the kids, huh?

158
00:06:14,740 --> 00:06:16,080
左一句亨利爸爸 右一句亨利爸爸
"Henry's dad". "Henry's dad".

159
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:18,780
我可是带乔到宽银幕影院看过《非洲女王号》
I took Joe to see "African Queen" in CinemaScope.

160
00:06:18,860 --> 00:06:20,400
又见面了 杰
Oh, hey. Good to see you again, Jay.

161
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:22,000
-你好 -你好 我是克莱
- Hi. - Hi, I'm Clay.

162
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:24,000
我想跟你握手 但我手受伤了
I'd shake your hand, but I'm a little banged up.

163
00:06:24,220 --> 00:06:26,700
我今早从五层高的大楼摔下来 落到网子上
I fell out of a five-story building this morning, into a net.

164
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:28,400
他今早从床上摔下来
?He fell out of bed this morning.

165
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:29,920
老婆
Hey, honey.

166
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,260
下来打个招呼
Come down and meet these guys.

167
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:32,960
嗨
Oh, hey!

168
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:38,040
欢迎 我是珍妮 亨利的妈妈
