515
00:19:58,960 --> 00:19:59,880
好了 闭嘴
Okay, stop it.

516
00:20:02,520 --> 00:20:04,460
太好玩了
That was so fun.

517
00:20:04,660 --> 00:20:06,180
我的心砰砰跳
My heart is racing.

518
00:20:06,520 --> 00:20:08,560
那又如何 我的智能手表打给我的心脏医生了
You? My watch dialed my cardiologist.

519
00:20:09,180 --> 00:20:11,040
我从没逃过警察
I've never run from the cops before.

520
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:12,020
我也没有啊
Me either.

521
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:13,060
灯
Lights!

522
00:20:14,900 --> 00:20:18,180
我都等不及要跟大家说你们多酷了
I can't wait to tell everyone how cool you guys are!

523
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:19,500
我们不酷 乔
We're not cool, Joe.

524
00:20:20,220 --> 00:20:21,260
正常人不应该
That's not what people do

525
00:20:21,260 --> 00:20:22,500
在警察叫他们靠边停时这么做
when a policeman pulls them over.

526
00:20:22,580 --> 00:20:24,520
其实我们俩一点酷的地方都没有
In fact, there's nothing cool about us.

527
00:20:24,760 --> 00:20:25,980
我们也不需要这么泼冷...
Well, I don't think we should be lumped into --

528
00:20:26,100 --> 00:20:26,540
灯
Lights!

529
00:20:28,060 --> 00:20:30,300
乔 世上还有很多比酷更重要的事
Joe, there are more important things than being cool.

530
00:20:30,840 --> 00:20:32,160
比如什么
Uh, like what?

531
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:34,140
乔 重点是我们太爱你
Look, the point is, Joe, we love you too much

532
00:20:34,140 --> 00:20:36,580
把你宠到你觉得做这样的蠢事是可以的
to let you think dumb moves like this are okay.

533
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:39,580
那我们现在该做什么
So, what do we do now?

534
00:20:40,300 --> 00:20:41,640
我们要做正确的事
We're gonna do the right thing.

535
00:20:47,700 --> 00:20:48,200
警官
Officer!

536
00:20:55,360 --> 00:20:56,200
肉桂面包店在哪里啊
Where's Cinnabon?

537
00:20:58,600 --> 00:21:01,520
不用想也知道 他们检举我用太多松焦油
Sure enough, they call me out for using too much pine tar.

538
00:21:01,940 --> 00:21:05,096
我冲出去跟裁判大吵
I run out there and just go berserk on these umpires.

539
00:21:05,096 --> 00:21:06,790
但大家记得...
But everybody remembers -- ?Ugh!

540
00:21:06,860 --> 00:21:07,760
小心 这里是垒包
Watch out. That's a base. ?Yeah.

541
00:21:08,220 --> 00:21:09,320
-这里是三垒 -三垒
- That's third base. - Third base.

542
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:10,680
我当年也是三垒手 还记得吗
That's where I used to play. You remember that?

543
00:21:11,140 --> 00:21:12,580
当然 我们要来...
Yeah. Should we do --

544
00:21:12,580 --> 00:21:14,180
所以你当年会站在这里
So, when you would stand here,

545
00:21:14,340 --> 00:21:16,254
会保持一个运动员的...
you would just kind of basically be in an athletic --

546
00:21:16,254 --> 00:21:17,420
-我当年打大学橄榄球 -你会站到这里
- I played college football... - ?You would get here.

547
00:21:17,420 --> 00:21:19,040
会这么站在这里 然后念叨着
You would get right here like this and say,

548
00:21:19,220 --> 00:21:20,120
"千万别打到我这边来"
"Please don't hit it to me".

549
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:22,440
我也是这个感觉
That's how I feel!

550
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:24,040
敢打来你就死定了
I'm gonna get you back!
